          <div class="container">
            <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Animation shelf</p><h2 id="anime-heading">Worlds to disappear into.</h2></div><a class="section-link" href="#/explore">Browse all <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
